olio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SubstrateRegime.lean#L43-L45","doc":"**The substrate regime**: `1 < q < φ`.  Above the classical point,\nbelow the golden-ratio `S₅`/Bring resonance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.one_lt_goldenRatio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.one_lt_goldenRatio","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SubstrateRegime.lean#L36-L41","doc":"`1 < φ` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.goldenRatio_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.goldenRatio_sq","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SubstrateRegime.lean#L29-L34","doc":"`φ² = φ + 1` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.goldenRatio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.goldenRatio","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SubstrateRegime.lean#L26-L27","doc":"The **golden ratio** `φ = (1 + √5)/2`, root of `q² - q - 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}